&lt;h2 id="前期准备">前期准备
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Draw 选项卡下将焦距设置为85mm，视情况设置Align To Object&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Render - Render Properties下激活AO&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/zbrush-render/images/AO.webp"
width="214"
height="489"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="43"
data-flex-basis="105px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>调整Shadow&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/zbrush-render/images/Shadow.webp"
width="237"
height="200"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="118"
data-flex-basis="284px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>调整灯光分别渲染 Keylight 和 RimLight&lt;/p>
&lt;p>主光用 Orb Clay，补光用 Basic Material&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/zbrush-render/images/Key.webp"
width="2120"
height="1252"
loading="lazy"
alt="KeyLight"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="169"
data-flex-basis="406px"
> &lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/zbrush-render/images/Rim.webp"
width="2120"
height="1252"
loading="lazy"
alt="RimLight"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="169"
data-flex-basis="406px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>分别导出 Shaded、Depth、Mask，由于深度图和Mask一致，最终得到4张图，保存为PSD格式方便处理&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="ps合成">PS合成
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>对补光&lt;kbd>Ctrl+L&lt;/kbd>色阶调整，提高对比度，之后擦除不想让边缘光产生的位置&lt;/p>
&lt;p>此时的边缘光有较多锯齿，导入Mask，将通道作为选区&lt;br>
&lt;kbd>Ctrl+Shift+C&lt;/kbd>→隐藏Mask图层→&lt;kbd>Ctrl+V&lt;/kbd>，得到一张背景透明的渲染主体A&lt;/p>
&lt;p>新建合适的背景图层并与A合并&lt;/p>
&lt;p>将&lt;code>Depth&lt;/code>复制至新通道，以它为源对A做镜头模糊
&lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/zbrush-render/images/Blur.webp"
width="2538"
height="1420"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="178"
data-flex-basis="428px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>放两张效果图&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/zbrush-render/images/rock1.webp"
width="2120"
height="1252"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="169"
data-flex-basis="406px"
> &lt;img src="https://siya-33.github.io/post/zbrush-render/images/rock2.webp"
width="2120"
height="1279"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="165"
data-flex-basis="397px"
>&lt;/p>
